title: Analytics › Monthly report › Open and build
route: /analytics
intro: 'Monthly report' opens a small window where the Analyst agent builds the report in four short steps, about 3 seconds. Cancel, Close, Escape and a click outside all stop it. Closing throws the build away.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the steps are a timer, 0.75 seconds each. The report is built from the period, payer, program, diagnosis group and site view chosen when the window opened. Escape closes the window, and a menu opened beforehand closes first, one press each.
---
start s1 "Click 'Monthly report' (top right)"
overlay o1 "Window 'Monthly report'\nSubtitle 'This quarter · Both sites · All payers · All programs · All diagnosis groups'\n'Built by' Analyst\nButton 'Cancel' in the footer"
process p0 "Page behind is dimmed\nThe menus cannot be used until the window closes"

group gSteps "Four steps"
  agent a1 "Analyst\n'Collecting the decisions for this quarter'"
  wait w1 "0.75 seconds"
  agent a2 "Analyst\n'Dropping any figure with fewer than 20 decisions'"
  wait w2 "0.75 seconds"
  agent a3 "Analyst\n'Writing the summary'"
  wait w3 "0.75 seconds"
  agent a4 "Analyst\n'Laying out the report'"
  wait w4 "0.75 seconds"
endgroup

process p1 "Each step shows a spinner while it runs, then a green tick\nSteps still to come have a grey dot and grey text"

screen r1 "Panel 'Your report is ready'\n'Same figures as this page, for the site view and filters you have set. Save a file or print it.'\nButtons 'Download report', 'Download data (CSV)' and 'Print'\nFooter button now reads 'Done'"

group gClose "Close it at any moment"
  click c1 "Click 'Cancel' (while building) or 'Done' (when ready)"
  click c2 "Click the X ('Close')"
  input k1 "Press Escape"
  click c3 "Click the dimmed area outside the window"
endgroup

process p2 "Window closes at once\nNothing is downloaded and the page is unchanged"
process p3 "Opening it again starts again from step 1"
decision q1 "Was the build still running?"
endx e1 "Build abandoned if it was still running"
end e2 "Back on Analytics"
goto g1 "Continues in: Analytics › Monthly report › Download the files"

s1 --> o1 --> p0
o1 --> a1 --> w1 --> a2 --> w2 --> a3 --> w3 --> a4 --> w4 --> r1
a1 -.-> p1
r1 --> g1
o1 --> c1 & c2 & k1 & c3
r1 --> c1
c1 & c2 & k1 & c3 --> p2 --> q1
p2 -.-> p3
q1 -->|Yes| e1
q1 -->|No| e2
